      "I was the oldest of {number} children": 1,
      "I have {number} brothers": 4,
      "I have {number} sisters": 4,
      "that's how I ended up in {place}": 2,
      "it was tough": 11,
      "I'll never forget it": 3,
      "I graduated from high school": 5,
      "I went to high school in {place}": 1,
      "looking back, {clause}": 17,
      "I grew up in a small town": 5,
      "I grew up on a farm": 6,
      "it was difficult": 8,
      "I've been here ever since": 1,
      "my mother was {occupation}": 20,
      "I was born and raised in {place}": 20,
      "I was very lucky": 2,
      "my {parent} died": 6,
      "that's where I met my {relation}": 2,
      "I was an only child": 2,
      "we lived there until I was {age}": 1,
      "I was raised by my {guardian}": 2,
